BSc APM Case Study Data: Terms of Use
Copyright (C) BSc APM Case Study 2025-2026. All rights reserved.

This repository holds encrypted personal data about case study participants. It is
not released under an open license.

1. Encrypted file. You may copy and redistribute `dataset.enc` only unmodified and
   with this notice. No other right is granted.

2. Decrypted data. The secret required for decryption stays with the author
   and is given only to reviewers the author authorises, who first agree to
   these conditions in writing:
   a. Use the data only to verify or reproduce the thesis's reported analysis.
   b. Do not try to identify any participant or link the data with other
      information that could.
   c. Do not share or publish the decrypted data, the secret, or any extract that
      could identify a participant.
   d. Store the decrypted data securely, and delete it and the secret once
      verification is done or within 6 months of receipt, whichever is first.
   e. Report any suspected disclosure to the author without delay.
   f. Credit the thesis as the source of the data, by citing it, in any work
      that draws on the data.

3. These terms grant no rights in the participants' personal data beyond their
   consent. Processing must comply with the GDPR.

4. The data is provided as is, without warranty.

